Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Design the smallest authentic task that fills a consequential evidence gap. Tailor context and resources to the learner while preserving the competency, and specify what would count as success before the new work is submitted.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
